  "geometry": "the map registered to the city's own Washington Square plan district outline (Framework/Tigard_Planning MapServer layer 1, community-plan-areas.geojson): scale 0.23006 px/ft (4.35 ft per pixel), rotation -0.2 degrees; 99.1% of the outline's points fall on the map's drawn boundary line",
